  "explanation": "The question asks for the birth date of Stephen O’Mara. The provided sources present two distinct individuals named Stephen O’Mara:\n\n1. From **Document D1S2**, we learn that *Stephen Mary O’Mara* was born on **5 January 1884** and died on 11 November 1959. This is directly stated in the text.\n\n2. From **Document D2S1**, we find another *Stephen O’Mara (senator)* who was born on **26 December 1844** and died on 26 July 1926. This is also explicitly stated.\n\nBoth dates are valid and refer to different people with the same name. There is no evidence in the provided sources to conflate these two individuals or to discard either claim. Therefore, both answers are retained."
